[00:00.00] 作曲 : Nujabes
[00:01.00] 作词 : Shing02
[00:16.69]Once again, now where do I start, dear love  再一次，我该从何说起，我亲爱的
[00:19.30]Dumb struck with the pure luck to find you here  能在这里找到你真是无以言喻的运气
[00:21.78]Every morn' I awake from a cavernous night,  每个从空荡的夜里醒来的清晨
[00:24.44]Sometimes still pondering the previous plight,  我有时还是会想起之前的约定
[00:26.92]Seems life done changed long time no speak,  这么久没有说唱 生活似乎确实改变了
[00:29.62]Nowadays I often forget the day of the week  我常常忘记今天是周几
[00:31.78]Taking it by stride if you know what I mean,  如果你能懂我 我会松一口气
[00:34.41]No harm done, no offense taken by me  别被我伤害 别生我的气
[00:37.25]So let's rap, we'll catch up to par, what's the haps?  还是说唱吧，能抓住每一拍
[00:39.96]Perhaps we're even closer now after all things considered on this side of the planet,  真是走运 在星球这边思索的这些事情 让我们更加亲密
[00:44.83]Couldn't pick a better time even if we planned it!  我想不到可以与你相遇的更好的时机
[00:48.14]To come clean and candid if I have to  非要如此 那么我选择干净坦诚
[00:50.74]Oh what I wouldn't trade for your laughter  既然什么都无法换得你的笑容
[00:53.27]Sweet and sour spice in my poetry pot melting,  甜蜜酸楚都融入我的诗里
[00:55.95]Even better than the real thing!  仍好过现实世界
[00:58.07]It's like the God in me saw the Devil in you  神圣如我遇见邪恶如你
[01:00.31]I wanted to break myself in the worst way when I met you  我遇见你便已丢掉自己
[01:04.04]Who would have thought, conversate by the river, celebrate birth,  想不到庆祝生日的方式是在河边聊天
[01:07.17]Sit and delivered the lines that would prove to be the seeds of trust  我交付你全部的信任
[01:10.89]Unsigned, yeah but destined to grow with sunshine  没有签署姓名，我却相信会命中注定
[01:13.46]Self-assigned task piled on the desk of good works,  桌子上堆放着我要做好的事
[01:15.99]Knowing hardship appreciate the best of both worlds!  知道了困苦是世间最好的恩赐
